# GK2 Donkey API: the donkeys and carts kept with this save, written after each save (docs/persistence.md).
# The game's own save does not need this file; without it the donkeys simply don't come back.
# Fixture: a real side file of the 0.30.0 build (format 2, the writer unchanged since 0.29.1), the dev machine's
# Steam_1 slot on 2026-10-17: five instances (the named donkey with its cart and its colour settings, foals, carts),
# two mods' counters. Kept as written so the reader of every later version is tried on it.
